  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, sweet smoked paprika, garlic, ginger, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chicken thighs to the bowl and toss to coat evenly with the marinade.",
    "Transfer the chicken to a large Dutch oven or oven-safe pot with a lid.",
    "Add the chopped dried apricots and chicken broth to the pot.",
    "Cover the pot with a lid and transfer to the preheated oven.",
    "Roast the chicken for 30 minutes, then remove the lid and continue roasting for an additional 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the pot from the oven and sprinkle the chopped fresh parsley over the top.",
    "Let the chicken rest for 10 minutes before serving."
  ],
